  "preamble": "Palatalization of the velar fricative [x] to the postalveolar [ʃ] before front vowels and *j. It is the outcome of *x in the Slavic first palatalization (*x > *xʲ > *š), which exactly reverses the ruki retraction of *š to *x.",
